  <h2>Launching Fast in the Social Era</h2>
  <p>The US and UK markets are increasingly driven by micro-communities. As a <strong>Supply Chain Partner</strong>, we have developed a specific "Speed-to-Market" track for influencer-led brands.</p>

  <h3>Agile Inventory Management</h3>
  <p>Use selected existing stock styles for a trial after availability is checked. New OEM/ODM designs usually require 150–250 pcs per style per color, subject to the brief. Compare actual sales before expanding a style or committing to a larger <strong>inventory plan</strong>.</p>

  <h3>Viral-Ready Logistics</h3>
  <p>When demand rises, check stock and replenishment before promising a date. Confirm the actual express-freight route, chargeable weight, destination, customs scope and transit estimate separately from factory dispatch.</p>
